{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"CSP-J/S 衔接建议","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：CSP-J/S 衔接建议。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"CSP-J（入门级）与 CSP-S（提高级）每年 9-10 月举行，是 NOIP 的前置认证。J 组考枚举、模拟、递归、简单 DP、基础数据结构；S 组在此基础上加图论、数论、高级 DP、字符串。建议高一先用本书过 J 组知识点，高二冲 S 组，高三视情况打 NOIP/省选。\n\n---","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":12,"grade_min":10,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「CSP-J/S 衔接建议」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"CSP-J/S 衔接建议","slug":"senior-algorithms-topic-12","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「CSP-J/S 衔接建议」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":24,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-012-main","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"634922d6d45d9e0e67e245a5927a1777795206cc061df7dc56091c479deaa83b","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/634922d6d45d9e0e/02-算法竞赛入门经典.md"},"stage":"SENIOR","title":"CSP-J/S 衔接建议"},"content_hash":"ffc16ad9efdd5182597c404fba2575707194484a9741104e4039d99f95038150","course":{"slug":"senior-algorithms","title":"算法竞赛入门","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
